architecture.h4_f:
msg = CBOR{v:1, text, reply_to, sent_at}
ct = AES-GCM-256-Encrypt (k, nonce, msg, aad=room_id)
POST /api/rooms/{id}/messages {ciphertext: hex(ct), nonce: hex}

cryptoWire.h1_f:
pt = CBOR{v:1, text, reply_to?, thread_id?, mentions?, sent_at}
ct = AES-GCM-256-Encrypt (room_key, nonce, pt, aad=hex (room_id))
filu = CBOR{
  v: 1,
  ciphertext: hex(ct), // lunghezza variabile
  nonce: hex (12 B),
  sender_pseudo: hex (16 B),
  sent_at: unix_ms
}

cryptoWire.h5_f:
esterno = CBOR{
  source_node: hex32,
  target_user: int64,
  inner_ciphertext: bytes,
  inner_nonce: bytes,
  sent_at: unix_ms
}
sig = Ed25519-Sign (source_priv, esterno)
POST /federazione/deliver { busta: esterno, sig: hex64 }

auth.h1_f:
POST /api/authentication/register
  { username, password, x25519_public_key, display_name, phone ?, email ?, avatar_emoji }

Risposta 201 Creata:
  {access_token, refresh_token, user_id, username, ... }

auth.h3_f:
access_token payload:
  {sub: user_id, jti: device_id, typ: "accessu", exp: avà + 15min }
Carica utile di refresh_token:
  {sub: user_id, jti: device_id, typ: "refresh", exp: avà + 30d }

HS256-firmatu cù u sicretu di 64 byte di node da .env

auth.h4_f:
register_begin(): sfida = rand (32)
                    opzioni = { rp.id, user.id, pubKeyCredParams, sfida }
                    opzioni di ritornu

register_finish(attestazione):
  verificate l'attestazione contr'à TPM / Secure Enclave root CA
  store { credential_id, public_key, counter: 0}

auth.h7_f:
POST /api/authentication/qr/begin
  → { nonce: 128-bit hex, ttl: 60 }
QR payload = { nonce, user_id, server: "https://node.example" }

POST /api/authentication/qr/verify {nonce}
  → novu dispusitivu arregistratu; I JWT sò tornati.

rooms.h6_f:
sender_pseudo = HMAC-SHA256(room_pseudo_salt, sender_id)[:16] // 32 hex
ciphertext = AES-GCM-Encrypt (room_key, nonce, CBOR_payload, aad=room_id)

Fan-out frame: { type: "m", room, msg: {id, ct, nonce, sender_pseudo, sent_at} }

files.h2_f:
init POST /api/files/resumable/init {filename, size, chunk_size_hint}
            ← {upload_id, chunk_size}
chunk PUT /api/files/resumable/{upload_id}/chunk/{offset} <ct bytes>
            ← 204
finalize POST /api/files/resumable/{upload_id}/finalise {plain_blake3}
            ← 201 {file_id, url}
TTL in finitu: 24 h

files.h4_f:
deny_list = {
  "applicazione/x-dosexec",
  "application/x-sharedlib",
  "applicazione/x-mach-binary",
}
if magic.from_buffer(buf[:1024]) in deny_list: return 415

presence.h1_f:
client: à u primu tastu → mandate {type:"t", state:"start"}
         ùn manda più per 3 s, salvu chì u statu cambia
         10 s dopu l'ultimu tastu → mandate {type:"t", state:"stop"}
ricevitore: auto-stop 10 s dopu l'ultimu "start" se ùn ci hè micca "stop".

calls.h1_f:
POST /api/calls/{room_id}/start {video, audio} → call_id
WS broadcast {type: "c", kind: "invite", call_id}
WS broadcast {tipu: "c", tipu: "offerta", sdp}
WS broadcast {tipu: "c", tipu: "risposta", sdp}
WS broadcast {type:"c", kind:"candidate",ice} × N
POST /api/calls/{call_id}/end

federation.h2_f:
busta = {
  source_node : hex32,
  target_user : int64,
  inner_ciphertext: bytes,
  inner_nonce : bytes,
  sent_at : unix_ms,
}
sig = Ed25519Sign(source_priv, CBOR(busta))
POST /federazione/consegna { busta, sig }

gossip.h3_f:
publicità = {pubkey, endpoint, advertised_at}
sig = Ed25519-Sign(pubkey_priv, CBOR(publicità))
gossip payload: [..., {ad, sig}, ...]

ricevitore: verificate sig contru ad.pubkey → store iff ok
supplementu: PoW di 2^18 zeri principali nantu à {pubkey, endpoint}

stealth.h2_f:
ClientHello bytes = chrome_120_template cù {
  casuale = u nostru casu,
  server_name = u nostru hostname (o ECH-wrapped),
  session_id = u nostru ID di sessione,
}
JA4 = t13d_xxxx_xxxx_xxxx (corrisponde à l'attuale stabile di Chrome)

stealth.h4_f:
DoH: POST https://cloudflare-dns.com/dns-query {nome: x.vortexx.sol}
ECH: ClientHello.extensions += encrypted_sni (public_key_from_HTTPS_record)
DGA: duminiu (t) = base32 ( SHA256 (semente ∥ YYYY-MM-DD) )[:16] + ".esempiu"

push.h4_f:
iOS NSE: didReceive (richiesta) { decrypt (request.content.userInfo) }
Android FCM: onMessageReceived (remoteMessage) { decrypt (remoteMessage.data) }
Web SW: self.addEventListener('push', e => decrypt (e.data))

controller.h2_f:
strumentu = sign_tool
input = arbre source, keys/release.key
manifestu = {
  versione: "0.1.0",
  built_at: unix_ms,
  schedari: [[{path, sha256, size}, ...]
}
sig = Ed25519-Sign(release_priv, CBOR(manifest))
output = INTEGRITY.sig.json = {manifestu, signed_by: pub_hex, sig: sig_hex}

bots.h1_f:
creà: POST /api/bots {username, display_name, code}
          → {bot_id, token, pubkey}
run: in-process (coroutine in u node)
      OR esterni (long-poll /api/bots/{id}/updates, token-auth'd)
missaghju: {testu, firma: Ed25519-Sign(bot_priv, canonical_msg)}

